      177.57,
      202.97,
      386.12,
      226.31
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE SRI LANKA INSTITUTE OF TAXATION(INCORPORATION) ACT, NO. 21 OF 2000",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      238.97,
      401.88,
      274.31
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS the Sri Lanka Institute of Taxation wasincorporated by the Sri Lanka Institute of Taxation(Incorporation) Act, No. 21 of 2000:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      286.97,
      401.86,
      310.31
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the Sri Lanka Institute of Taxation nowwishes to change its name to:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      171.81,
      322.97,
      378.6,
      334.31
    ],
    "text": "\u201cThe Chartered Institute of Taxation of Sri Lanka\u201d:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      346.97,
      401.9,
      394.31
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS the said Sri Lanka Institute of Taxation has nowapplied to have the said Act amended to give effect to suchchange in its name and it will be expedient to grant suchapplication:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      406.97,
      401.89,
      430.31
    ],
    "text": "BE it therefore, enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      442.97,
      401.87,
      466.31
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act, may be cited as the Sri Lanka Institute ofTaxation (Incorporation) (Amendment) Act, No. of 2022.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      478.97,
      401.9,
      550.31
    ],
    "text": "2.(1) Sri Lanka Institute of Taxation (Incorporation)Act, No. 21 of 2000 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipalenactment\u201d) is herey amended by the substitution for thewords \u201cSri Lanka Institute of Taxation\u201d wherever they appearin the principal enactment of the words \u201cChartered Instituteof Taxation of Sri Lanka\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      562.97,
      401.89,
      598.31
    ],
    "text": "(2) In any written law, there shall be substituted for thewords \u201cSri Lanka Institute of Taxation\u201d of the words\u201cChartered Institute of Taxation of Sri Lanka\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      610.97,
      401.89,
      670.31
    ],
    "text": "3.(1) All rights, liabilities, obligations, contracts,agreements, certificates or other instruments, documents,whatsoever, made, issued signed in writing or executed priorthe the date of the commencement of this Act, by or in favourof the \u201cSri Lanka Institute of Taxation\u201d shall be deemed from",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      241.03,
      440.13,
      250.1
    ],
    "text": "Preamble",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
